{"type":"urn:miot-spec-v2:device:toothbrush:0000A07E:nancii-t600:1","description":"Toothbrush","services":[{"iid":1,"type":"urn:miot-spec-v2:service:device-information:00007801:nancii-t600:1","description":"Device Information","properties":[{"iid":1,"type":"urn:miot-spec-v2:property:manufacturer:00000001:nancii-t600:1","description":"Device Manufacturer","format":"string","access":["read"]},{"iid":2,"type":"urn:miot-spec-v2:property:model:00000002:nancii-t600:1","description":"Device Model","format":"string","access":["read"]},{"iid":3,"type":"urn:miot-spec-v2:property:serial-number:00000003:nancii-t600:1","description":"Device ID","format":"string","access":["read"],"comment":"设备ID"},{"iid":4,"type":"urn:miot-spec-v2:property:firmware-revision:00000005:nancii-t600:1","description":"Current Firmware Version","format":"string","access":["read"]},{"iid":5,"type":"urn:miot-spec-v2:property:serial-no:000000FF:nancii-t600:1","description":"Serial Number","format":"string","access":["read","notify"],"comment":"SN码"}],"comment":"设备信息"},{"iid":5,"type":"urn:miot-spec-v2:service:battery:00007805:nancii-t600:1","description":"Battery","properties":[{"iid":1003,"type":"urn:miot-spec-v2:property:battery-level:00000014:nancii-t600:1","description":"Battery Level","format":"uint8","access":["notify","read"],"unit":"percentage","value-range":[0,100,1],"source":3,"comment":"电池电量"}],"comment":"电池"},{"iid":6,"type":"urn:nancii-spec:service:other:00007801:nancii-t600:1","description":"other","properties":[{"iid":1,"type":"urn:nancii-spec:property:timestamp:00000001:nancii-t600:1","description":"timestamp","format":"uint32","access":["read","write","notify"],"value-range":[0,4294967295,1],"comment":"设置时间校准，小端格式传输，参考原来使用自定义BLE服务时定的协议"},{"iid":2,"type":"urn:nancii-spec:property:work-mode:00000002:nancii-t600:1","description":"work-mode","format":"uint8","access":["read","notify","write"],"value-range":[1,5,1],"comment":"工作模式，一个字节，表示当前的工作模式，原来协议定义的是选择模式，参考原来使用自定义BLE服务时定的协议"},{"iid":3,"type":"urn:nancii-spec:property:splash-proof:00000003:nancii-t600:1","description":"splash-proof","format":"bool","access":["read","notify","write"],"comment":"防飞溅功能，布尔值，true表示打开，false表示关闭，参考原来使用自定义BLE服务时定的协议"},{"iid":4,"type":"urn:nancii-spec:property:reset-brush-head:00000004:nancii-t600:1","description":"reset-brush-head","format":"bool","access":["read","notify","write"],"comment":"重置刷头信息，包括已使用时长、次数、倒计时；布尔类型，true表示重置，参考原来使用自定义BLE服务时定的协议"},{"iid":5,"type":"urn:nancii-spec:property:count-down:00000005:nancii-t600:1","description":"count-down","format":"uint32","access":["read","notify","write"],"value-range":[0,4294967295,1],"comment":"刷头倒计时信息，4个字节，参考原来使用自定义BLE服务时定的协议"},{"iid":6,"type":"urn:nancii-spec:property:battery-capacity:00000006:nancii-t600:1","description":"battery-capacity","format":"uint8","access":["read","notify","write"],"unit":"percentage","value-range":[0,100,1],"comment":"电池电量信息，1个字节， 参考原来使用自定义BLE服务时定的协议"},{"iid":7,"type":"urn:nancii-spec:property:used-duration:00000007:nancii-t600:1","description":"used-duration","format":"uint16","access":["read","notify","write"],"value-range":[0,65535,1],"comment":"刷头已使用时长，手机获取，两个字节，参考原来使用自定义BLE服务时定的协议"},{"iid":8,"type":"urn:nancii-spec:property:used-count:00000008:nancii-t600:1","description":"used-count","format":"uint16","access":["read","notify","write"],"value-range":[0,65535,1],"comment":"刷头已使用次数，手机App获取，2个字节，参考原来使用自定义BLE服务时定的协议"},{"iid":9,"type":"urn:nancii-spec:property:motor-stat:00000009:nancii-t600:1","description":"motor-stat","format":"bool","access":["read","notify","write"],"comment":"电机状态，手机获取或者设备主动推送；布尔类型，true表示开状态， false表示关状态； 参考原来使用自定义BLE服务时定的协议"},{"iid":10,"type":"urn:nancii-spec:property:history-data:0000000a:nancii-t600:1","description":"history-data","format":"string","access":["read","notify","write"],"comment":"历史记录"},{"iid":11,"type":"urn:nancii-spec:property:set-mode-one:0000000b:nancii-t600:1","description":"set-mode-one","format":"uint32","access":["read","notify","write"],"value-range":[0,4294967295,1],"comment":"设置模式1，四个字节，uint32类型，最高8位表示设置的模式，最低8位表示模式对应的强度，中间两字节表示时长（大端模式，第三字节是高8位，第二字节是低8位），具体参考原来的协议"},{"iid":12,"type":"urn:nancii-spec:property:set-mode-two:0000000c:nancii-t600:1","description":"set-mode-two","format":"uint32","access":["read","notify","write"],"value-range":[0,4294967295,1],"comment":"设置模式2，四个字节，uint32类型，最高8位表示设置的模式，最低8位表示模式对应的强度，中间两字节表示时长（大端模式，第三字节是高8位，第二字节是低8位），具体参考原来的协议"},{"iid":13,"type":"urn:nancii-spec:property:set-mode-three:0000000d:nancii-t600:1","description":"set-mode-three","format":"uint32","access":["read","notify","write"],"value-range":[0,4294967295,1],"comment":"设置模式3，四个字节，uint32类型，最高8位表示设置的模式，最低8位表示模式对应的强度，中间两字节表示时长（大端模式，第三字节是高8位，第二字节是低8位），具体参考原来的协议"},{"iid":14,"type":"urn:nancii-spec:property:set-mode-four:0000000e:nancii-t600:1","description":"set-mode-four","format":"uint32","access":["read","notify","write"],"value-range":[0,4294967295,1],"comment":"设置模式4，四个字节，uint32类型，最高8位表示设置的模式，最低8位表示模式对应的强度，中间两字节表示时长（大端模式，第三字节是高8位，第二字节是低8位），具体参考原来的协议"},{"iid":15,"type":"urn:nancii-spec:property:set-mode-five:0000000f:nancii-t600:1","description":"set-mode-five","format":"uint32","access":["read","write","notify"],"value-range":[0,4294967295,1],"comment":"设置模式5，四个字节，uint32类型，最高8位表示设置的模式，最低8位表示模式对应的强度，中间两字节表示时长（大端模式，第三字节是高8位，第二字节是低8位），具体参考原来的协议"},{"iid":16,"type":"urn:nancii-spec:property:get-all-status:00000010:nancii-t600:1","description":"get-all-status","format":"bool","access":["read","notify","write"],"comment":"手机插件下发这个标志，触发后设备上报所有状态，包括当前模式，所有模式参数，电量，刷头剩余时间"}],"comment":"自定义功能"}]}
